#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:20
msgid ""
"The protocol to use for communication with the registry server.  Either http "
"or https."
msgstr ""
"Protokol koji se koristi za komunikaciju sa zapisničkim serverom.Ili http "
"ili https."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:26
msgid ""
"The path to the key file to use in SSL connections to the registry server, "
"if any. Alternately, you may set the GLANCE_CLIENT_KEY_FILE environment "
"variable to a filepath of the key file"
msgstr ""
"Put do ključnog fajla koji se koristi u SSL vezama sa serverom registra, ako "
"postoji. Alternativno, možete postaviti GLANCE_CLIENT_KEY_FILE varijablu "
"okoline na putanju ključnog fajla"

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:31
msgid ""
"The path to the cert file to use in SSL connections to the registry server, "
"if any. Alternately, you may set the GLANCE_CLIENT_CERT_FILE environment "
"variable to a filepath of the CA cert file"
msgstr ""
"Put do cert fajla, koji se koristi u SSL vezama sa registar serverom, ako "
"postoji. Alternativno, možete postaviti GLANCE_CLIENT_CERT_FILE varijablu "
"okruženja na putanju CA cert fajla"

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:36
msgid ""
"The path to the certifying authority cert file to use in SSL connections to "
"the registry server, if any. Alternately, you may set the "
"GLANCE_CLIENT_CA_FILE environment variable to a filepath of the CA cert file."
msgstr ""
"Put za ovjeru cert autoriteta koji se koristi u SSL vezama sa serverom "
"registra, ako postoje. Alternativno, možete postaviti GLANCE_CLIENT_CA_FILE "
"varijablu okruženja na putanju CA cert fajla."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:42
msgid ""
"When using SSL in connections to the registry server, do not require "
"validation via a certifying authority. This is the registry's equivalent of "
"specifying --insecure on the command line using glanceclient for the API."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom korištenja SSL-a u vezama sa serverom registra, ne zahtijeva se "
"validacija preko autoriteta za ovjeravanje. To je registarski ekvivalentno "
"navođenju --nesigurnosti na komandnoj liniji koju koriste glanceclient za "
"API-ja."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:36
msgid ""
"The period of time, in seconds, that the API server will wait for a registry "
"request to complete. A value of 0 implies no timeout."
msgstr ""
"Vremenski period, u sekundama, koji će API server čekati da se zahtjev "
"registra završi. Vrijednost 0 znači bez vremenskog ograničenja."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:64
msgid ""
"Whether to pass through the user token when making requests to the registry. "
"To prevent failures with token expiration during big files upload, it is "
"recommended to set this parameter to False.If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect, then admin credentials can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Bilo da prođe kroz korisnikovu oznaku prilikom pravljenja zahtjeva u "
"registru. Da biste spriječili kvarove sa oznakom isticanja tokom učitavanja "
"velikih datoteka, preporučuje se da postavite ovaj parametar na False.If "
"\"use_user_token\" nije na snazi, onda se može navesti akredativa "
"administratora."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:73
msgid ""
"The administrators user name. If \"use_user_token\" is not in effect, then "
"admin credentials can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Administratorovo ime korisnika. Ako \"use_user_token\" nije na snazi, onda "
"se može navesti akredativa administratora."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:78
msgid ""
"The administrators password. If \"use_user_token\" is not in effect, then "
"admin credentials can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Administratorova lozinka. Ako \"use_user_token\" nije na snazi, onda "
"akredativa administratora može biti specificirana."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:83
msgid ""
"The tenant name of the administrative user. If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect, then admin tenant name can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Ime zakupca administrativnog korisnika. Ako \"use_user_token\" nije na "
"snazi, onda ime zakupca admina može biti specificirano."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:88
msgid ""
"The URL to the keystone service. If \"use_user_token\" is not in effect and "
"using keystone auth, then URL of keystone can be specified."
msgstr ""
"URL servisa glavnog pincipa. Ako \"use_user_token\" nije na snazi i koristi "
"glavni izvorni princip, onda URL glavnog principa može biti specificiran."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:94
msgid ""
"The strategy to use for authentication. If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect, then auth strategy can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Način koji koristi ovjera. Ako \"use_user_token\" nije na snazi, onda "
"strategije ovjere mogu biti specificirane."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:99
msgid ""
"The region for the authentication service. If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect and using keystone auth, then region name can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Regija servisa ovjere. Ako \"use_user_token\" nije na snazi i koristi glavni "
"izvorni princip, onda ime regije može biti specificirano."

